		<ThingDef ParentName="SweetMealBase">
		<defName>IceCreamcoconut</defName>
		<label>IceCream(coconut)</label>
		<description>"When the Imperial Food Department first classified the coconut as a 'tree nut', it caused a riot among botanists. Then they disappeared. Now we eat this tropical nuisance, carefully grown in hydroponic plantations by prisoner gardeners (strictly voluntary, as per their work contracts)."
"The recipe was 'borrowed' from a tribe of island savages in exchange for glass beads and syphilis. Their chieftain wept when he tasted the ice cream. Perhaps from realizing the greatness of Imperial cooking. Or because we added his sacred totem pole to the freezing unit.".</description>
